| CP-STYLE-004 No Em Dash | Deterministic | Implement |

### Why not deterministic voice checking?

Counting words such as "you" or "your" cannot establish that the content actually maintains an in-role narrative.

A module can contain hundreds of second-person words and still sound detached or generic.

